{
  "description": "TAI64N handshake timestamps (protocol.md, Timestamp). seconds: 0x400000000000000a + unix seconds, 8 bytes big endian; nanoseconds aligned down to a multiple of 2^24, 4 bytes big endian. A responder accepts a timestamp only if it is bytewise greater than the last accepted one from the same static key.",
  "nanosecond_alignment": 16777216,
